        "collapsible_item_j36Km7": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "1-Large Warehouse Space to Stock Materials",
            "content": "<p>NADCO operates a spacious warehouse with 35,000 square feet dedicated to housing substantial quantities of high-quality inventory. This capacity allows us to keep materials consistently in stock for our customers. Warehousing also provides a controlled environment to safely store surplus goods.</p><p>Stock shortages can result in significant profit loss, as customers may turn to competitors when items aren’t available. NADCO’s warehousing services help prevent these gaps by ensuring a steady, reliable supply and continuous flow of goods.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_antcPw": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "2-We Can Accept Blanket Orders with Specific Release Dates",
            "content": "<p>NADCO can take blanket orders with set release dates, ensuring customers always have the printed products they need without delays. We produce a large batch of your items and store them at our facility, releasing them whenever you need more.</p><p>By committing to a larger quantity, customers get significant cost savings without having to store excess product themselves.</p><p>The key advantages of a blanket order are avoiding extra stock, reducing the administrative work of frequent purchase orders, and benefiting from volume-based discounts.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_mCrH7h": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "3-Large Material Portfolio",
            "content": "<p>At NADCO, we rely on a diverse network of trusted suppliers rather than a single source for our raw materials. This approach gives us exceptional flexibility, ensuring we can consistently provide the right materials—even when certain items are difficult to obtain. Our extensive material portfolio also empowers us to handle fully customized projects with reliability and precision, giving customers confidence that their needs will be met without compromise.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_fe4PKV": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "4-Staying One Step Ahead on Materials",
            "content": "<p>At NADCO, we proactively update our inventory, maintain ample stock, and secure material substitutes well before supplies run low. Because supplier shipping times can be unpredictable, keeping a strong inventory on hand gives us greater control and reduces the risk of delays. This readiness helps prevent stock-outs or shortages, ensuring we can deliver the products our customers need—right when they need them.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_q9jiFm": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "5-We Offer Expedited Services",
            "content": "<p>NADCO offers expedited services for most projects, enabling us to deliver some of the fastest turnaround times in the industry. These services help ensure your order is completed on or ahead of schedule, while also reducing supply chain delays. By accelerating production and delivery, expediting can even help lower overall costs and keep your project moving smoothly.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
